SURVEY : LINUX AND COMPUTER MUSIC

We are taking the opportunity of the JIM2000 Computer Music
Conference in Bordeaux, May 15 - 18, to prepare a survey of
Linux-based projects in computer music. If you are involved in such a
project, please complete and send back this short questionnaire. The
results of the survey will be presented during the special Linux
session at the Conference and published on the conference web site.
Thank you for taking the time to do this!

http://www.scrime.u-bordeaux.fr/JIM2000/call.htm



